      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOODNIGHT HEIDI (1) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at Hobart over 461m (26.65). Yet to win at the journey but has run some good races. Better than last start and worth following up. BUCKLE UP ARLO (2) struggled in tougher grade last start after missing the jump at this track, but prior to that won by 2.25 lengths at Hobart (19.65) beating Miss Sue Lee in a Maiden on September 29. Comes through a solid form race last start. Cannot be taken lightly. REALITY AWAY (6) wasn't far away at the finish when 5th and beaten only 2.75 lengths (30.25) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Bold showing expected. BUCKLE UP ALLIE (4) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
